title: Luca
---
<<declare $helpedLuca = false>>

<<if $helpedLuca>>
    Luca: Thanks again for helping me!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Luca: Hey! I am going to propose today and I need your help. Are you free today?

-> No, sorry.
    <<jump DeclineLuca>>
-> Yeah, I have time. <<if getBool("hasChapelPass") and hasActions()>>
        <<jump HelpLuca>>
===

title: HelpLuca
---
<<useAction>>
<<set $helpedLuca = true>>
Luca: Perfect! I want her to be in the Quad by the Afternoon. Convince her to be there during class, ok? Thanks!
<<stop>>
===

title: DeclineLuca
---
Luca: That's okay! I got this! Yea! All by myself! Hmmmm....
<<stop>>
===

title: LucaLate
---
<<if getBool("teacherDistracted")>>
    Luca: Ah Sweet! He didn't notice me coming in! 
<<else>>
    Teacher: I see you slept in again...

    Luca: Sorry, I'm a chud.

    Teacher: We know...
<<endif>>

<<stop>>
===
